Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:19:59.84,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\an8}可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:01.63,On Top,,0,0,0,,{\an8}第42名 A班 青山优雅
